From 470bdca718255c0749cef1e6af6553c25b7ff596 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spartanz51 <a.m@tuta.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:04:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [sdk] Load a blob element from its archive

Adds BlobFacade::load_blob_element for BlobElement types such as
MailDetailsBlob: requests an archive-scoped read token and fetches the
element from the blob servers, with the same retry and failover as
blob downloads. It returns the JSON payload; parsing and decryption
with the owner's session key are left to the caller.
